{
  "description": "Golden Q&A set for the CoreAlign AI Helper RAG. Each case asserts that retrieval surfaces a relevant source (recall@k) and avoids forbidden sources. A source matches when its title OR sourceRef contains (case-insensitive) any string in expectAny; a case fails its guard when any source matches forbidAny.",
